type: software
title: "tavlarena-dice: a verifier for TavlArena's provably fair dice"
abstract: "A dependency-free TypeScript library and offline CLI that recomputes every roll of a TavlArena game from the server's revealed seed and both players' contributions (commit-reveal, encoding v1), with independent test vectors."
authors:
  - name: "The TavlArena team"
